    "text": "The calculated spin-only magnetic moments <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> of the anionic and cationic species of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtext>Fe</mtext><msub> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>6</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mtext>Fe&#160;</mtext><msub><mfenced><mtext>CN</mtext></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> respectively, are:"
